#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-SEND-0129.1 expect=noViolation domain=SE
#note "PROPOSED-RULE scenario (ruling 8). As invalid, but SESTDTC declared with def:Origin Type=Collected and no method: the sheet conditions the requirement on 'was not directly collected', so a directly-collected SESTDTC needs no method. Proposed rule silent. CURRENT rule ignores the Origin condition -> predicted-red: engine reports exactly 1 violation (variable_name=SESTDTC) where this scenario expects noViolation."
#library standard=sendig version=3-1-1
#define-xml CDISC-SEND-0129.1-collected-define.xml
dataset SE
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col ETCD    type=Char
col SESTDTC type=Char
